# Every text file is LF in the repository and in every working tree, whatever
# core.autocrlf says (it is true system-wide on the Windows dev box). Prettier,
# EditorConfig and CI all expect LF. See upskilling/04-journal/J02.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
*.db-wal binary
*.db-shm binary
